Well, there are a lot of things.  For example, take a look at ALSA
BTS: 
	https://bugtrack.alsa-project.org/alsa-bug/

You'll find quite many pending bugs.  Sorting these problems out needs
more hands, eyes and a little bit brain.

For other fields, helps for more documentation, better on-line
information, HOWTOs, tutorials, etc would be appreciated, too.

Above all, it's an open-source development.  Feel free to do anything
you're interested in :)


